件！在景区被一只猴子大老远叫过去要和我合影，我心想好热情的大叔，然后我就拿手机和他拍了几张照片，走的时候硬拉着我胳膊不让我走，跟我要钱！几块就算了，就三张照片和我要三十，他明明可以抢的，非要在拍个照浪费时间。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1957013258721955968"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1956906814978851293","created_at":"2025-08-17T02:31:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956906814978851293"],"id":"1956906814978851293","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7310,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一个个就知道给我私信发屌，有本事线下solo？隔着屏幕诱惑算什么英雄好汉，刚醒就给我勾引湿了，太过分了！","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1956906814978851293"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1956688049057972676","created_at":"2025-08-16T12:02:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956688049057972676"],"id":"1956688049057972676","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7418,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"妈妈呀我都5k粉了！那我也表示表示我准备了看过就能立的福利，但不一定符合所有人胃口，互相欣赏～","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1956688049057972676"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1956609478717296844","created_at":"2025-08-16T06:50:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956609478717296844"],"id":"1956609478717296844","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6483,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我醒悟了！在情绪低落的时候自慰真的能缓解心情，但只是暂时的，人不可能每天都在自我安慰中度过","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1956609478717296844"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1956303937856024671","created_at":"2025-08-15T10:36:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956303937856024671"],"id":"1956303937856024671","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6771,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"能理解，我欲望来了的时候我也想做爱我也想约，但手冲完冷静下来之后就不想了，这只是大脑被欲望控制了，但不要真去约，你不想未来爱你的那个姑凉伤心吧？那就要学会爱自己","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1956303937856024671"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1956257029213053239","created_at":"2025-08-15T07:29:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956257029213053239"],"id":"1956257029213053239","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12991,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"陪老爸出来钓鱼随便走走，脚受伤这段时间都没出过门，连续睡了一个礼拜，今天好些了出来钓钓鱼。 https://t.co/udE2CMeIYZ","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1956257029213053239"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1956219450547691673","created_at":"2025-08-15T05:00:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956219450547691673"],"id":"1956219450547691673","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6906,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在推上你看看就得了呗，你还真信啊？在网上怎么可能约得到人，四十岁的大妈也不一定跟你出来","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1956219450547691673"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955953736779751541","created_at":"2025-08-14T11:24:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955953736779751541"],"id":"1955953736779751541","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12576,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"顾看电视把煮面这回事忘的干干净净，在晚来一会就溢的到处都是了 https://t.co/cCp5L2C5Mi","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1955953736779751541"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955909035926151464","created_at":"2025-08-14T08:27:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955909035926151464"],"id":"1955909035926151464","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6970,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有个男生一直喜欢我，有意没意的献殷勤，我每天到班里水杯里的水都给我打好了，我们学校热水收费，一学期了光水费都有20了吧？但他又从来没和我表白过，真不理解他图什么，好奇怪人类。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1955909035926151464"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955798298713055495","created_at":"2025-08-14T01:07:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955798298713055495"],"id":"1955798298713055495","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6906,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我第一次看的片是黑人的，那个男的家伙事给我留下了心理阴影，记得当时给那个女的弄的嗷嗷叫，我以为这是一种酷刑而且生殖器比我胳膊还粗就那么一整根插进去了，是个人都得嗷嗷叫吧？当时好害怕出人命","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1955798298713055495"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955612584503320865","created_at":"2025-08-13T12:49:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955612584503320865"],"id":"1955612584503320865","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6463,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我是我们宿舍最后搬进去的，她们三个已经很熟悉了经常聊天，经常一块打闹，唯独我每天回宿舍和她们又不是很熟，有一句没一句的，有一种被孤立的感觉，还不方便玩手机，所以我不想住校了","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1955612584503320865"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955210869715112348","created_at":"2025-08-12T10:12:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955210869715112348"],"id":"1955210869715112348","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":40143,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"对于这种舍友无语了..... https://t.co/P9ojNeO71K","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1955210869715112348"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955162846926606548","created_at":"2025-08-12T07:02:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955162846926606548"],"id":"1955162846926606548","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7199,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我低血糖我有一次真的冲昏迷了，被叫醒都下午我妈下班回来了，我裤衩子都没提，战场都没打扫全被我妈看光了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1955162846926606548"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1955110410740449335","created_at":"2025-08-12T03:33:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955110410740449335"],"id":"1955110410740449335","lang":"zh"